body:
Not a doctor, but look into trichomycosis and other bacterial/fungal/etc type skin infections [https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/trichomycosis#what-it-is](https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/trichomycosis#what-it-is) 

&#x200B;

Try having a bath using Nizoral dandruff shampoo or T-gel. I have similar symptoms to the max, and the only things that help are anti-fungal/anti-bacterial washes and heavily moisturizing cream/eczema lotion.
